    {
      "body": "Resolved the upstream conflict in `7c892598`. #42391 already contains the platform fixture fix; this PR now contributes only four E2E/load × CUDA/HIP policy regression cases. Fresh validation: **95 passed** with native CUDA policy and **95 passed** with simulated HIP policy. Production thresholds are unchanged. Local pre-commit and GitHub lint passed.\n\nLogs and exact diff: https://github.com/Tokha233/ComfyUI-H3-SpeedKit/tree/8791760/evidence/pr-maintenance-1005 . The new GPU workflows stop at the `run-ci` authorization gate; maintainer authorization is needed for hosted validation.\n",
      "created_at": "2026-10-04T20:49:19Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/42250#issuecomment-5984245182",
